  "translation": "Nĩareire, na rũru ũthamaki nĩwe ũrĩ megie kana mũcoko, ta ũrĩa ciira cĩte; na atongoria na arĩa mahiũraga theremba megie harĩ ũthamaki; na andũ othe a bũrũri makĩigua na gũkeno, mahiũraga theremba. Athalaya nĩagwetire ⟨את⟩ nguo ciake, ndĩagwetire kũuga atĩrĩ: Ũhunjiri! Ũhunjiri!",
